// 可编辑地形 P1 的实体接入（terrain.go、game/terrainmap、handler TerrainEdit）端到端：真实 Nest 引擎与生成的 handler /
// Sender / lifecycle、真实地形包与视图。
//
// 离线用例的持久层是替身：提交器只收下记录（可注入一次拒绝），“库”是重启时从上一进程每个 TerrainChunk 实体的 DAO
// 编出来的文档（与 world 的 timer 测试 restartWorld 同一做法：内存里的 DAO 就是已提交的状态，回滚由生成 setter 的
// 逆操作还原）。真实 Mongo 上的同一条重启流程（DataEngine 的 WAL → 投影 → 冷加载 / 新建准入门 → 重启后按 _id 读
// 记录）见 TestTerrainRestartRealMongo，门变量 ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI（scripts/test-demo-generated.sh 设置）。

// terrainSeed 与 terrainMeta 是测试地图：3 × 2 块（192m × 128m），程序化地形，水位线 400m。
const terrainSeed = 20261108

func terrainMeta(revision int64) terrain.Meta {
	return terrain.Meta{BaseRevision: revision, ChunksX: 3, ChunksY: 2, WaterLevel: 40000}
}

func writeTerrainPack(t *testing.T, dir string, revision int64) string {
	t.Helper()
	path := filepath.Join(dir, fmt.Sprintf("terrain-r%d.pack", revision))
	meta := terrainMeta(revision)
	if err := terrain.WritePackFile(path, meta, terrain.Generated(meta, terrainSeed)); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	return path
}

func wholeMap(meta terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error) {
	return terrainmap.Region{Own: meta.Bounds(), Load: meta.Bounds()}, nil
}

// errInjectedRejection 是提交器注入的一次明确拒绝（不是结果未知：引擎不 fence，事务整条回滚）。
var errInjectedRejection = errors.New("injected commit rejection")

type terrainCommitter struct {
	reject  atomic.Bool
	commits atomic.Int64
}

func (c *terrainCommitter) Commit(context.Context, nest.CommitRecord) error {
	if c.reject.CompareAndSwap(true, false) {
		return errInjectedRejection
	}
	c.commits.Add(1)
	return nil
}

// memoryChunkStore 是 coredata.Store 的替身：只答 terrainmap.ReadRecords 发的 `_id $in` 查询。docs 里也有玩家编辑
// 账本（TerrainEditor）的文档：实体 ID 的 kind 不同，与块的 ID 不会相同；查询按集合过滤。
type memoryChunkStore struct {
	mu   sync.Mutex
	docs map[int64]coredata.RawDocument
}

func (s *memoryChunkStore) ReadConsistent(ctx context.Context, read func(context.Context) error) error {
	return read(ctx)
}

func (s *memoryChunkStore) Load(ctx context.Context, spec coredata.LoadSpec) ([]coredata.RawDocument, error) {
	var out []coredata.RawDocument
	err := s.StreamLoad(ctx, spec, func(doc coredata.RawDocument) error { out = append(out, doc); return nil })
	return out, err
}

func (s *memoryChunkStore) StreamLoad(_ context.Context, spec coredata.LoadSpec, consume func(coredata.RawDocument) error) error {
	if spec.Resource != db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection {
		return fmt.Errorf("unexpected resource %q", spec.Resource)
	}
	in, ok := spec.Filter["_id"].(map[string]any)["$in"].([]int64)
	if !ok {
		return fmt.Errorf("unexpected filter %v", spec.Filter)
	}
	s.mu.Lock()
	defer s.mu.Unlock()
	for _, id := range in {
		if doc, ok := s.docs[id]; ok && doc.Key.Resource == spec.Resource {
			if err := consume(doc); err != nil {
				return err
			}
		}
	}
	return nil
}

// terrainProcess 是一个 game 进程里与地形有关的部分：实体管理器、Nest 引擎、TerrainChunk 的 lifecycle 与 Map。
type terrainProcess struct {
	t         *testing.T
	ctx       context.Context
	entities  *entity.EntityManager
	engine    *nest.NestMgr
	committer *terrainCommitter
	m         *terrainmap.Map
	stats     terrainmap.LoadStats
	// buildingStats 是启动时建筑对账（ReconcileBuildings）的结果。
	buildingStats terrainmap.BuildingStats
}

// startTerrainProcess 照 startTerrain 的顺序：打开包、接建筑（不分区的普通场景）、按 store 里的记录装入、发布、建筑对账。
func startTerrainProcess(t *testing.T, pack string, region func(terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error), store coredata.Store) *terrainProcess {
	t.Helper()
	return startTerrainProcessWith(t, pack, region, store, nil)
}

// startTerrainProcessWith 是 startTerrainProcess，beforeLoad 在 Nest 启动之后、Map.Load 之前调用（例如让提交器拒绝
// Load 里的第一笔丢弃事务）。
func startTerrainProcessWith(t *testing.T, pack string, region func(terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error), store coredata.Store, beforeLoad func(*terrainProcess), options ...nest.NestOption) *terrainProcess {
	t.Helper()
	handler.RegisterTerrainEditNestHandlers()
	handler.RegisterBuildingNestHandlers()
	terrain_chunk.RegisterEntity()
	terrain_editor.RegisterEntity()
	building.RegisterEntity()
	p := &terrainProcess{t: t, ctx: context.Background(), entities: entity.NewEntityManager(), committer: &terrainCommitter{}}
	if memory, ok := store.(*memoryChunkStore); ok {
		p.restoreEntities(memory)
	}
	access := entity.NewManagerAccess(p.entities)
	p.engine = nest.NewEngine(append([]nest.NestOption{
		nest.NestOptionWithGetter(access),
		nest.NestOptionWithTransactionCommitter(p.committer),
		nest.NestOptionWithWorkerPools(nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 4, QueueCap: 256}, nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 1, QueueCap: 64}, nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 2, QueueCap: 64}),
	}, options...)...)
	if err := p.engine.Start(); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	chunks, err := lifecycle.NewTerrainChunkLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	editors, err := lifecycle.NewTerrainEditorLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	buildings, err := lifecycle.NewBuildingLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	p.m, err = terrainmap.Open(pack, region, chunks, editors, syncsender.NewTerrainEditSender(p.engine))
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	p.m.EnableBuildings(buildings, syncsender.NewBuildingSender(p.engine))
	if beforeLoad != nil {
		beforeLoad(p)
	}
	if p.stats, err = p.m.Load(p.ctx, store); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	terrainmap.Install(p.m)
	t.Cleanup(p.stop)
	if p.buildingStats, err = p.m.ReconcileBuildings(p.ctx); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	return p
}

// restoreEntities 替身 DataEngine 的冷加载：离线进程没有加载器，GetOrCreate 找不到实体就会新建一个空的；真实进程
// 里它从库里冷加载已有记录（TestTerrainRestartRealMongo 走的就是那条路）。这里在启动时把“库”里的每条记录（块与玩家
// 编辑账本）建成实体放进管理器，效果与改块前冷加载相同。
func (p *terrainProcess) restoreEntities(store *memoryChunkStore) {
	p.t.Helper()
	store.mu.Lock()
	defer store.mu.Unlock()
	for id, doc := range store.docs {
		var param *entity.EntityCreateParam
		switch doc.Key.Resource {
		case db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection:
			dao := db.NewTerrainChunkDao()
			dao.SetId(id)
			if err := dao.RestorePersisted(doc.Data, doc.Schema, doc.Version); err != nil {
				p.t.Fatalf("restore chunk entity %d: %v", id, err)
			}
			param = &entity.EntityCreateParam{Kind: terrain_chunk.EntityKindTerrainChunk, Id: id,
				Dao: map[string]entity.DaoInterface{db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection: dao}}
		case db.TerrainEditorDaoCollection:
			dao := db.NewTerrainEditorDao()
			dao.SetId(id)
			if err := dao.RestorePersisted(doc.Data, doc.Schema, doc.Version); err != nil {
				p.t.Fatalf("restore edit ledger %d: %v", id, err)
			}
			param = &entity.EntityCreateParam{Kind: terrain_editor.EntityKindTerrainEditor, Id: id,
				Dao: map[string]entity.DaoInterface{db.TerrainEditorDaoCollection: dao}}
		case db.BuildingDaoCollection:
			dao := db.NewBuildingDao()
			dao.SetId(id)
			if err := dao.RestorePersisted(doc.Data, doc.Schema, doc.Version); err != nil {
				p.t.Fatalf("restore building %d: %v", id, err)
			}
			param = &entity.EntityCreateParam{Kind: building.EntityKindBuilding, Id: id,
				Dao: map[string]entity.DaoInterface{db.BuildingDaoCollection: dao}}
		default:
			p.t.Fatalf("document %d in an unknown collection %q", id, doc.Key.Resource)
		}
		built, err := entity.BuildEntity(param)
		if err != nil {
			p.t.Fatalf("rebuild entity %d: %v", id, err)
		}
		p.entities.Add(built)
	}
}

// stop 是进程停下：Nest 先停（不再有改块事务），再撤下 Map。可重复调用。
func (p *terrainProcess) stop() {
	if p.engine != nil {
		_ = p.engine.Shutdown(context.Background())
		p.engine = nil
	}
	if p.m != nil {
		_ = p.m.Close()
		terrainmap.Install(nil)
	}
}

// persist 把本进程每个 TerrainChunk 实体、每个 Building 实体与 editorPlayers 里玩家的编辑账本的 DAO 编成“库里的
// 文档”（进程停下之后调用：没有并发访问）。
func (p *terrainProcess) persist(store *memoryChunkStore) {
	p.t.Helper()
	store.mu.Lock()
	defer store.mu.Unlock()
	if store.docs == nil {
		store.docs = map[int64]coredata.RawDocument{}
	}
	for _, key := range p.m.Keys() {
		id, err := terrain_chunk.EntityID(key)
		if err != nil {
			p.t.Fatal(err)
		}
		value, ok := p.entities.Get(id).(*terrain_chunk.TerrainChunk)
		if !ok || value == nil {
			continue
		}
		store.docs[id] = coredata.RawDocument{
			Key:  coredata.DocumentKey{Database: db.TerrainChunkDaoDBName, Resource: db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection, ID: id},
			Data: value.Dao().Marshal(), Schema: db.TerrainChunkDaoSchemaVersion, Version: 1,
		}
	}
	p.entities.Range(func(e entity.IThreadSafeEntity) bool {
		if b, ok := e.(*building.Building); ok && b != nil {
			store.docs[b.ID()] = coredata.RawDocument{
				Key:  coredata.DocumentKey{Database: db.BuildingDaoDBName, Resource: db.BuildingDaoCollection, ID: b.ID()},
				Data: b.Dao().Marshal(), Schema: db.BuildingDaoSchemaVersion, Version: 1,
			}
		}
		return true
	})
	for _, player := range editorPlayers {
		id, err := terrain_editor.EntityID(player)
		if err != nil {
			p.t.Fatal(err)
		}
		value, ok := p.entities.Get(id).(*terrain_editor.TerrainEditor)
		if !ok || value == nil {
			continue
		}
		store.docs[id] = coredata.RawDocument{
			Key:  coredata.DocumentKey{Database: db.TerrainEditorDaoDBName, Resource: db.TerrainEditorDaoCollection, ID: id},
			Data: value.Dao().Marshal(), Schema: db.TerrainEditorDaoSchemaVersion, Version: 1,
		}
	}
}

// cornerEdits 是跨四块交点的一组改动：采样点 (60..67, 60..67) 落在块 (0,0)、(1,0)、(0,1)、(1,1) 里。
func cornerEdits() []terrainmap.SampleEdit {
	var edits []terrainmap.SampleEdit
	for gy := int64(60); gy < 68; gy++ {
		for gx := int64(60); gx < 68; gx++ {
			edits = append(edits, terrainmap.SampleEdit{GX: gx, GY: gy, Height: uint16(100 + gx + gy), Material: 7})
		}
	}
	return edits
}

// terrainSnapshot 是整张图上每隔 37 单位一个点的查询结果（含块边界与采样点之间的插值位置），以及每块的版本。
type terrainSnapshot struct {
	ground   []terrain.Ground
	errs     []string
	versions map[terrain.ChunkKey]int64
}

func snapshotTerrain(m *terrainmap.Map) terrainSnapshot {
	s := terrainSnapshot{versions: map[terrain.ChunkKey]int64{}}
	b := m.Meta().Bounds()
	for y := b.Min.Y; y < b.Max.Y; y += 37 {
		for x := b.Min.X; x < b.Max.X; x += 37 {
			g, err := m.Probe(x, y)
			s.ground = append(s.ground, g)
			if err != nil {
				s.errs = append(s.errs, err.Error())
			} else {
				s.errs = append(s.errs, "")
			}
		}
	}
	for _, key := range m.Keys() {
		if v, ok := m.View().Version(key); ok {
			s.versions[key] = v
		} else {
			s.versions[key] = -1
		}
	}
	return s
}

func sampleHeight(t *testing.T, m *terrainmap.Map, gx, gy int64) int32 {
	t.Helper()
	h, err := m.Height(gx*terrain.SampleSpacing, gy*terrain.SampleSpacing)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("height at sample (%d, %d): %v", gx, gy, err)
	}
	return h
}

// 改块 → 提交 → 查询返回新值；被拒绝（回滚）的事务不改变视图与实体；停下、重新启动（新的实体管理器、新视图、从
// “库”装覆盖块）后整张图逐点与重启前一致、每块 Version 一致。
func TestTerrainEditsSurviveARestart(t *testing.T) {
	dir := t.TempDir()
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 1)
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	first := startTerrainProcess(t, pack, wholeMap, store)
	if first.stats.Chunks != 6 || first.stats.Base != 6 || first.stats.Overlays != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("first start: %+v, want 6 chunks all from the pack", first.stats)
	}
	m := first.m
	baseHeight := sampleHeight(t, m, 61, 61)

	versions, err := m.Edit(first.ctx, cornerEdits())
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("corner edit: %v", err)
	}
	want := map[terrain.ChunkKey]int64{{X: 0, Y: 0}: 1, {X: 1, Y: 0}: 1, {X: 0, Y: 1}: 1, {X: 1, Y: 1}: 1}
	if len(versions) != len(want) {
		t.Fatalf("corner edit committed %v, want %v", versions, want)
	}
	for key, v := range want {
		if versions[key] != v {
			t.Fatalf("corner edit committed %v, want %v", versions, want)
		}
	}
	// 提交之后（回复在 AfterCommit 之后）查询就是新值：四块交点两侧的采样点都改了。
	for _, p := range [][2]int64{{60, 60}, {63, 63}, {64, 64}, {67, 67}, {63, 64}, {64, 63}} {
		if got, want := sampleHeight(t, m, p[0], p[1]), m.Meta().WorldHeight(uint16(100+p[0]+p[1])); got != want {
			t.Fatalf("sample %v after the edit: height %d, want %d", p, got, want)
		}
	}
	if got := sampleHeight(t, m, 61, 61); got == baseHeight {
		t.Fatalf("sample (61, 61) still has its base height %d", got)
	}
	if mat, err := m.Material(65*terrain.SampleSpacing+50, 65*terrain.SampleSpacing+50); err != nil || mat != 7 {
		t.Fatalf("material inside the edit: %d, %v", mat, err)
	}
	if _, err := m.Edit(first.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 10, GY: 10, Height: 5000, Material: 2}, {GX: 11, GY: 10, Height: 5001, Material: 2}}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if v, _ := m.View().Version(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 0, Y: 0}); v != 2 {
		t.Fatalf("chunk (0,0) is at version %d after its second edit, want 2", v)
	}

	// 回滚：已改过的块 (1,0) 上一笔被提交器拒绝的改动，视图与实体都不变。
	before10, beforeVersion, _ := m.View().Chunk(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 1, Y: 0})
	first.committer.reject.Store(true)
	if _, err := m.Edit(first.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 70, GY: 5, Height: 1, Material: 1}}); !errors.Is(err, nest.ErrCommitRejected) || !errors.Is(err, errInjectedRejection) {
		t.Fatalf("rejected edit: %v, want ErrCommitRejected", err)
	}
	after10, afterVersion, _ := m.View().Chunk(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 1, Y: 0})
	if afterVersion != beforeVersion || !slices.Equal(after10.Heights, before10.Heights) || !slices.Equal(after10.Materials, before10.Materials) {
		t.Fatal("a rolled-back edit changed the view")
	}
	id10, _ := terrain_chunk.EntityID(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 1, Y: 0})
	if v := first.entities.Get(id10).(*terrain_chunk.TerrainChunk).Dao().GetVersion(); v != 1 {
		t.Fatalf("a rolled-back edit left chunk (1,0) at version %d, want 1", v)
	}
	// 没改过的块 (2,1) 的第一笔改动被拒绝：GetOrCreate 已建出空实体（Version 0），视图里仍是原始块。重启后这条空记录
	// 按原始块装入。
	base21, _, _ := m.View().Chunk(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 2, Y: 1})
	first.committer.reject.Store(true)
	if _, err := m.Edit(first.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 150, GY: 70, Height: 1, Material: 1}}); !errors.Is(err, nest.ErrCommitRejected) {
		t.Fatalf("rejected first edit: %v, want ErrCommitRejected", err)
	}
	if got, v, _ := m.View().Chunk(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 2, Y: 1}); v != 0 || !slices.Equal(got.Heights, base21.Heights) {
		t.Fatalf("a rolled-back first edit changed the view (version %d)", v)
	}
	if m.CommitFailures() != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("%d committed chunks did not reach the view", m.CommitFailures())
	}

	before := snapshotTerrain(m)
	first.stop()
	first.persist(store)
	if n := len(store.docs); n != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("%d chunk records stored, want 5 (four edited chunks and one empty entity)", n)
	}

	second := startTerrainProcess(t, pack, wholeMap, store)
	if second.stats.Overlays != 4 || second.stats.Base != 2 || second.stats.StaleBase != 0 || second.stats.Corrupt != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("restart: %+v, want 4 overlays (the edited chunks) and 2 from the pack (one never touched, one empty entity)", second.stats)
	}
	after := snapshotTerrain(second.m)
	if !maps.Equal(before.versions, after.versions) {
		t.Fatalf("versions before the restart %v, after %v", before.versions, after.versions)
	}
	if len(before.ground) != len(after.ground) {
		t.Fatalf("probed %d points before the restart and %d after", len(before.ground), len(after.ground))
	}
	for i := range before.ground {
		if before.ground[i] != after.ground[i] || before.errs[i] != after.errs[i] {
			t.Fatalf("point %d: before the restart %+v (%q), after %+v (%q)", i, before.ground[i], before.errs[i], after.ground[i], after.errs[i])
		}
	}
	t.Logf("restart: %d points and %d chunk versions identical; versions %v; load %+v", len(after.ground), len(after.versions), after.versions, second.stats)

	// 重启之后接着改，版本从库里的值继续加。
	if versions, err := second.m.Edit(second.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 1, GY: 1, Height: 9, Material: 9}}); err != nil || versions[terrain.ChunkKey{X: 0, Y: 0}] != 3 {
		t.Fatalf("edit after the restart: %v, %v (want version 3)", versions, err)
	}
}

// 原始地形换了版本（包换成 BaseRevision 2）：本进程写的块丢弃改动（维护者 2026-11-08）——记录经正式写路径（handler
// TerrainDiscard 的事务）重置为 Version 0 的空记录、这块回到新包的原始数据，重启后不再出现；丢弃事务失败时这块不装入
// （查询 ErrNotLoaded、改块 ErrUnloadable、库里记录不动），不用原始块盖住旧记录；邻格（Ghost 带）的旧记录不越权丢弃、
// 不装入。
func TestTerrainRecordOnAnotherBaseRevisionIsDiscarded(t *testing.T) {
	dir := t.TempDir()
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	first := startTerrainProcess(t, writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 1), wholeMap, store)
	for _, edit := range []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 5, GY: 5, Height: 1234, Material: 3}, {GX: 70, GY: 5, Height: 4321, Material: 4}} {
		if _, err := first.m.Edit(first.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{edit}); err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
	}
	first.stop()
	first.persist(store)
	k00, k10 := terrain.ChunkKey{}, terrain.ChunkKey{X: 1}
	stored00 := slices.Clone(store.docs[mustChunkID(t, k00)].Data)
	pack2 := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 2)
	fresh, err := terrain.OpenPack(pack2)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	defer fresh.Close()

	// 邻格：sid 1001 托管格 (0,0)、Ghost 带里装着格 (1,0) 的块。它丢弃自己的块，邻格的旧记录不碰、不装入。
	partition := settings.ScenePartition{Enabled: true, CellSize: terrain.ChunkSize, Cols: 3, Rows: 2, Owners: []string{"1001", "1002", "1003", "1004", "1005", "1006"}, GhostBand: 500, Hysteresis: 50}
	ghostStore := &memoryChunkStore{docs: maps.Clone(store.docs)}
	ghost := startTerrainProcess(t, pack2, func(meta terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error) { return terrainRegion(meta, partition, 1001) }, ghostStore)
	if ghost.stats.Discarded != 1 || ghost.stats.StaleBase != 1 {
		t.Fatalf("cell (0,0) on revision 2: %+v, want its own chunk discarded and the neighbour's not loaded", ghost.stats)
	}
	if _, loaded := ghost.m.View().Version(k10); loaded {
		t.Fatal("a neighbouring cell's stale chunk was loaded")
	}
	ghostID := mustChunkID(t, k10)
	if e, _ := ghost.entities.Get(ghostID).(*terrain_chunk.TerrainChunk); e == nil || e.Dao().GetVersion() != 1 || e.Dao().GetBaseRevision() != 1 {
		t.Fatal("the neighbouring cell's record was touched")
	}
	ghost.stop()

	// 丢弃事务被拒（第一笔：块 (0,0)）：这块不装入、库里的记录不动；块 (1,0) 照常丢弃。
	second := startTerrainProcessWith(t, pack2, wholeMap, store, func(p *terrainProcess) { p.committer.reject.Store(true) })
	if second.stats.StaleBase != 1 || second.stats.Discarded != 1 || second.stats.Overlays != 0 || second.stats.Base != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("load on revision 2 with the first discard refused: %+v, want 1 not loaded, 1 discarded, 5 from the pack", second.stats)
	}
	if cause, ok := second.m.Unloadable()[k00]; !ok || !errors.Is(cause, terrain.ErrBaseRevision) || !errors.Is(cause, errInjectedRejection) {
		t.Fatalf("chunk (0,0) unloadable reason: %v", cause)
	}
	if _, err := second.m.Height(5*terrain.SampleSpacing, 5*terrain.SampleSpacing); !errors.Is(err, terrain.ErrNotLoaded) {
		t.Fatalf("query in the chunk whose discard failed: %v, want ErrNotLoaded", err)
	}
	if _, err := second.m.Edit(second.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 5, GY: 5, Height: 1, Material: 1}}); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrUnloadable) {
		t.Fatalf("edit in the chunk whose discard failed: %v, want ErrUnloadable", err)
	}
	baseOf := func(key terrain.ChunkKey) terrain.Chunk {
		c, err := fresh.ReadChunk(key)
		if err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
		return c
	}
	if got, v, _ := second.m.View().Chunk(k10); v != 0 || !slices.Equal(got.Heights, baseOf(k10).Heights) {
		t.Fatalf("the discarded chunk (1,0) is at version %d and not the new base data", v)
	}
	second.stop()
	second.persist(store)
	if !slices.Equal(store.docs[mustChunkID(t, k00)].Data, stored00) {
		t.Fatal("the record whose discard failed was rewritten")
	}

	// 重启：(0,0) 这次丢弃成功；(1,0) 已是 Version 0 的空记录，按原始块装入，不再算丢弃。
	third := startTerrainProcess(t, pack2, wholeMap, store)
	if third.stats.Discarded != 1 || third.stats.StaleBase != 0 || third.stats.Overlays != 0 || third.stats.Base != 6 {
		t.Fatalf("restart on revision 2: %+v, want (0,0) discarded now and every chunk from the pack", third.stats)
	}
	for _, key := range third.m.Keys() {
		got, v, loaded := third.m.View().Chunk(key)
		if want := baseOf(key); !loaded || v != 0 || !slices.Equal(got.Heights, want.Heights) || !slices.Equal(got.Materials, want.Materials) {
			t.Fatalf("chunk %v after the discards: loaded %v version %d, not the new base data", key, loaded, v)
		}
	}
	// 丢弃之后照常改：从新包的原始块开始，记录基于版本 2。
	if versions, err := third.m.Edit(third.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 5, GY: 5, Height: 77, Material: 7}}); err != nil || versions[k00] != 1 {
		t.Fatalf("edit after the discard: %v, %v (want version 1)", versions, err)
	}
	third.stop()
	third.persist(store)
	fourth := startTerrainProcess(t, pack2, wholeMap, store)
	if fourth.stats.Discarded != 0 || fourth.stats.StaleBase != 0 || fourth.stats.Overlays != 1 || fourth.stats.Base != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("second restart: %+v, want no discard and the one new edit as an overlay", fourth.stats)
	}
	if h := sampleHeight(t, fourth.m, 5, 5); h != fourth.m.Meta().WorldHeight(77) {
		t.Fatalf("the edit after the discard reads %d after a restart", h)
	}
}

// DAO 的材质是 []uint16（D11），terrain 与原始地形包里是每点 1 字节：库里出现 > 255 的材质（不是本程序写出的）
// 按损坏的记录处理——这块不装入、计入 Corrupt，查询 ErrNotLoaded、改块 ErrUnloadable，不截断成别的材质。
func TestTerrainRecordWithAMaterialOutsideAByteIsNotLoaded(t *testing.T) {
	dir := t.TempDir()
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 1)
	first := startTerrainProcess(t, pack, wholeMap, store)
	if _, err := first.m.Edit(first.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 5, GY: 5, Height: 1234, Material: 3}, {GX: 70, GY: 5, Height: 4321, Material: 4}}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	first.stop()
	// 改坏 (0,0)：在一笔本地事务里把一个材质写成 300（生成 setter 只能在事务里调；写入口只接受 byte，正常路径写不出来），
	// 再编成“库里的文档”。
	k00 := terrain.ChunkKey{}
	e, _ := first.entities.Get(mustChunkID(t, k00)).(*terrain_chunk.TerrainChunk)
	if e == nil {
		t.Fatal("chunk (0,0) has no entity")
	}
	if _, err := nest.RunIsolatedTransaction(context.Background(), &terrainCommitter{}, "corrupt_material", func() (any, error) {
		return e.Dao().SetMaterialsAt(5*terrain.ChunkSamples+5, 300), nil
	}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	first.persist(store)

	second := startTerrainProcess(t, pack, wholeMap, store)
	if second.stats.Corrupt != 1 || second.stats.Overlays != 1 || second.stats.Base != 4 {
		t.Fatalf("load with material 300 in chunk (0,0): %+v, want it corrupt, (1,0) as an overlay, 4 from the pack", second.stats)
	}
	if cause, ok := second.m.Unloadable()[k00]; !ok || !errors.Is(cause, terrain.ErrInvalidChunk) {
		t.Fatalf("chunk (0,0) unloadable reason: %v (listed %v), want ErrInvalidChunk", cause, ok)
	}
	if _, err := second.m.Material(5*terrain.SampleSpacing, 5*terrain.SampleSpacing); !errors.Is(err, terrain.ErrNotLoaded) {
		t.Fatalf("query in the corrupt chunk: %v, want ErrNotLoaded", err)
	}
	if _, err := second.m.Edit(second.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 5, GY: 5, Height: 1, Material: 1}}); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrUnloadable) {
		t.Fatalf("edit in the corrupt chunk: %v, want ErrUnloadable", err)
	}
	if mat, err := second.m.Material(70*terrain.SampleSpacing, 5*terrain.SampleSpacing); err != nil || mat != 4 {
		t.Fatalf("the healthy overlay (1,0) reads material %d, %v", mat, err)
	}
}

// 分区场景里本 sid 托管格 (0,0)（cell_size 6400 = 一块）：写本格的块，装入本格外扩 ghost_band 的块；邻格的块只读。
// 只做 Base 的 sid 不装块。
func TestTerrainRegionFollowsThePartition(t *testing.T) {
	partition := settings.ScenePartition{Enabled: true, CellSize: terrain.ChunkSize, Cols: 2, Rows: 2, Owners: []string{"1001", "1002", "1003", "1004"}, GhostBand: 500, Hysteresis: 50}
	meta := terrainMeta(1)
	region, err := terrainRegion(meta, partition, 1001)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if want := (spatial.Rect{Max: spatial.Point{X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: terrain.ChunkSize}}); region.Own != want {
		t.Fatalf("own %v, want %v", region.Own, want)
	}
	p := startTerrainProcess(t, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), func(meta terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error) {
		return terrainRegion(meta, partition, 1001)
	}, &memoryChunkStore{})
	if p.stats.Chunks != 4 {
		t.Fatalf("cell (0,0) with its ghost band loads %d chunks, want 4 (its own and three neighbours')", p.stats.Chunks)
	}
	if !p.m.Owns(terrain.ChunkKey{}) || p.m.Owns(terrain.ChunkKey{X: 1}) || p.m.Owns(terrain.ChunkKey{Y: 1}) {
		t.Fatal("ownership does not follow the cell")
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Height(terrain.ChunkSize+10, 10); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("a ghost-band chunk is not readable: %v", err)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Edit(p.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 64, GY: 0, Height: 1}}); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrNotOwned) {
		t.Fatalf("edit in the neighbour's chunk: %v, want ErrNotOwned", err)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Edit(p.ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 63, GY: 63, Height: 1}}); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("edit in the own chunk: %v", err)
	}
	baseOnly, err := terrainRegion(meta, settings.ScenePartition{Enabled: true, CellSize: terrain.ChunkSize, Cols: 2, Rows: 2, Owners: []string{"1001", "1002", "1003", "1004"}, GhostBand: 500, Hysteresis: 50}, 2000)
	if err != nil || !baseOnly.Own.Empty() || !baseOnly.Load.Empty() {
		t.Fatalf("a Base-only sid: %+v, %v", baseOnly, err)
	}
	// 块跨格（格边长不是 6400 的倍数）在加载配置时拒绝；不开地形的分区场景不受影响。
	scene := settings.Scene{Partition: partition, Terrain: settings.SceneTerrain{Pack: "terrain.pack"}}
	scene.Partition.CellSize = 3000
	if err := scene.ValidateConfig(false); err == nil {
		t.Fatal("cell_size 3000 with terrain was accepted")
	}
	scene.Terrain.Pack = ""
	if err := scene.ValidateConfig(false); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("cell_size 3000 without terrain: %v", err)
	}
}

// gm.terrain.probe（terrainProbe）：报告的版本与摘要跟着视图走（编辑之后变、与按定义重算的摘要相同），点的高度是视图
// 里的原始值；不归本进程写、没装着的块与点如实报告；超过上限、地图外的块拒绝。
func TestTerrainProbeReportsTheView(t *testing.T) {
	partition := settings.ScenePartition{Enabled: true, CellSize: terrain.ChunkSize, Cols: 3, Rows: 2, Owners: []string{"1001", "1002", "1003", "1004", "1005", "1006"}, GhostBand: 500, Hysteresis: 50}
	p := startTerrainProcessWith(t, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), func(meta terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error) {
		return terrainRegion(meta, partition, 1001)
	}, &memoryChunkStore{}, func(p *terrainProcess) {
		policy := terrainmap.DefaultPolicy
		policy.EditPointsPerSecond = 0
		p.m.SetPolicy(policy)
	})
	probe := func() map[string]any {
		t.Helper()
		data, err := terrainProbe(p.m, gmTerrainProbePayload{Chunks: [][2]int32{{0, 0}, {1, 0}, {2, 0}}, Points: [][2]int64{{3200, 3200}, {13000, 100}}})
		if err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
		return data
	}
	chunk := func(data map[string]any, i int) map[string]any { return data["chunks"].([]map[string]any)[i] }
	point := func(data map[string]any, i int) map[string]any { return data["points"].([]map[string]any)[i] }
	digestOf := func(key terrain.ChunkKey) string {
		c, _, _ := p.m.View().Chunk(key)
		return terrainChunkDigest(c.Heights, c.Materials)
	}
	before := probe()
	own, ghost, outside := chunk(before, 0), chunk(before, 1), chunk(before, 2)
	if own["owned"] != true || own["loaded"] != true || own["version"] != int64(0) || own["held"] != int64(0) || own["digest"] != digestOf(terrain.ChunkKey{}) {
		t.Fatalf("own chunk before any edit: %v", own)
	}
	if ghost["owned"] != false || ghost["loaded"] != true || ghost["version"] != int64(0) {
		t.Fatalf("ghost-band chunk: %v", ghost)
	}
	if outside["owned"] != false || outside["loaded"] != false || outside["held"] != int64(-1) || outside["digest"] != nil {
		t.Fatalf("a chunk outside this process's region: %v", outside)
	}
	if h, err := p.m.Height(3200, 3200); err != nil || point(before, 0)["height"] != h {
		t.Fatalf("point (3200, 3200): %v, view %d %v", point(before, 0), h, err)
	}
	if point(before, 1)["err"] == nil {
		t.Fatalf("a point on an unloaded chunk: %v", point(before, 1))
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 300, Falloff: terrain.FalloffConstant, Strength: 50}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	after := probe()
	if c := chunk(after, 0); c["version"] != int64(1) || c["digest"] == own["digest"] || c["digest"] != digestOf(terrain.ChunkKey{}) {
		t.Fatalf("own chunk after a raise: %v (before %v)", c, own)
	}
	// 高度是世界高度（厘米）：原始值 + 50 是 + 500 厘米（夹在原始值上限 16383 以内）。
	if got, was := point(after, 0)["height"].(int32), point(before, 0)["height"].(int32); got != min(was+500, p.m.Meta().WorldHeight(16383)) {
		t.Fatalf("the raised point: %d, want %d + 500", got, was)
	}
	for _, bad := range []gmTerrainProbePayload{
		{Chunks: make([][2]int32, terrainProbeMaxChunks+1)},
		{Points: make([][2]int64, terrainProbeMaxPoints+1)},
		{Chunks: [][2]int32{{3, 0}}},
	} {
		if _, err := terrainProbe(p.m, bad); !errors.Is(err, admin.ErrCommandInvalid) {
			t.Fatalf("probe %d chunks / %d points %v: %v, want ErrCommandInvalid", len(bad.Chunks), len(bad.Points), bad.Chunks, err)
		}
	}
}

func mustChunkID(t *testing.T, key terrain.ChunkKey) int64 {
	t.Helper()
	id, err := terrain_chunk.EntityID(key)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	return id
}

// ---- 真实 Mongo ----

type terrainNoEffects struct{}

func (terrainNoEffects) Publish(context.Context, engine.OutboxItem) error {
	return errors.New("terrain edits emit no effect")
}

// realTerrainProcess 是带真实 DataEngine 的进程：MongoStore、文件 WAL、Projector、Outbox、Runtime（恢复屏障、冷加载、
// 新建准入门）与它的提交器上的 Nest。
type realTerrainProcess struct {
	runtime *engine.Runtime
	engine  *nest.NestMgr
	m       *terrainmap.Map
	stats   terrainmap.LoadStats
	fatal   chan error
	// buildingStats 是启动时建筑对账的结果。
	buildingStats terrainmap.BuildingStats
}

func startRealTerrainProcess(t *testing.T, ctx context.Context, client fmongo.IMongo, databases *coredata.DatabaseMap, physical, walDir, pack string) *realTerrainProcess {
	t.Helper()
	handler.RegisterTerrainEditNestHandlers()
	handler.RegisterBuildingNestHandlers()
	terrain_chunk.RegisterEntity()
	terrain_editor.RegisterEntity()
	building.RegisterEntity()
	p := &realTerrainProcess{fatal: make(chan error, 1)}
	store, err := engine.NewMongoStore(client, engine.MongoStoreConfig{DefaultDatabase: physical, Databases: databases})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if err := store.EnsureInfrastructure(ctx); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	wal, err := nestwal.Open(nestwal.DefaultOptions(walDir))
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	onFatal := func(err error) {
		select {
		case p.fatal <- err:
		default:
		}
	}
	projector, err := engine.NewProjector(wal, store, engine.ProjectorOptions{OnFatal: onFatal})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	outboxStore, err := engine.NewMongoOutboxStore(store)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	outbox, err := engine.NewOutboxWorker(outboxStore, terrainNoEffects{}, engine.OutboxWorkerOptions{Owner: "terrain-test"})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	access := entity.NewManagerAccess(entity.NewEntityManager())
	if p.runtime, err = engine.NewRuntime(store, wal, projector, outbox, access, nil, onFatal, engine.PipelinedRuntimeConfig{}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if err := p.runtime.Start(ctx); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	p.engine = nest.NewEngine(append(p.runtime.NestOptions(), nest.NestOptionWithGetter(access),
		nest.NestOptionWithWorkerPools(nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 4, QueueCap: 256}, nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 1, QueueCap: 64}, nest.WorkerPoolConfig{Workers: 8, QueueCap: 64}))...)
	if err := p.engine.Start(); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	chunks, err := lifecycle.NewTerrainChunkLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	editors, err := lifecycle.NewTerrainEditorLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	buildings, err := lifecycle.NewBuildingLifecycle(access)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if p.m, err = terrainmap.Open(pack, wholeMap, chunks, editors, syncsender.NewTerrainEditSender(p.engine)); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	p.m.EnableBuildings(buildings, syncsender.NewBuildingSender(p.engine))
	if p.stats, err = p.m.Load(ctx, p.runtime.Store); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	terrainmap.Install(p.m)
	t.Cleanup(func() { p.stop(t) })
	if p.buildingStats, err = p.m.ReconcileBuildings(ctx); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	return p
}

// stop 是正常停机的顺序：Nest 先停，DataEngine 排空投影、关 WAL，最后撤下 Map。可重复调用。
func (p *realTerrainProcess) stop(t *testing.T) {
	ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 30*time.Second)
	defer cancel()
	if p.engine != nil {
		if err := p.engine.Shutdown(ctx); err != nil {
			t.Errorf("nest shutdown: %v", err)
		}
		p.engine = nil
	}
	if p.runtime != nil {
		if err := p.runtime.Shutdown(ctx); err != nil {
			t.Errorf("dataengine shutdown: %v", err)
		}
		p.runtime = nil
	}
	if p.m != nil {
		_ = p.m.Close()
		p.m = nil
		terrainmap.Install(nil)
	}
	select {
	case err := <-p.fatal:
		t.Errorf("dataengine fatal: %v", err)
	default:
	}
}

// 真实 Mongo 上改块重启一致：第一次改块经新建准入门落库空实体、改块事务 strict 提交进 WAL 并投影；正常停机后用同一个
// WAL 目录重新启动，Map 按 _id 从库里读回覆盖块，整张图逐点与重启前一致、每块 Version 一致；重启后冷加载已有实体继续
// 改。门变量 ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI 指向副本集；用唯一库名，结束时删除。
func TestTerrainRestartRealMongo(t *testing.T) {
	uri := os.Getenv("ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI")
	if uri == "" {
		t.Skip("ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI not set")
	}
	ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 3*time.Minute)
	defer cancel()
	client, err := mongodriver.NewClient(fmongo.DefaultConfig(uri), mongodriver.IndexMigrationPolicy{})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	// 清理登记在进程之前：t.Cleanup 后进先出，库在两个进程都停下（投影排空）之后才删。
	t.Cleanup(func() { _ = client.Close(context.Background()) })
	physical := fmt.Sprintf("terrain_it_%d", time.Now().UnixNano())
	t.Cleanup(func() { _ = client.Database(physical).Drop(context.Background()) })
	databases, _, err := coredata.NewDatabaseMap(coredata.DatabaseMapConfig{
		Declared: coredata.DeclaredDatabases(), Configured: map[string]string{db.TerrainChunkDaoDBName: physical},
	})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	dir := t.TempDir()
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 1)
	walDir := filepath.Join(dir, "wal")

	first := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack)
	if first.stats.Base != 6 || first.stats.Overlays != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("first start on an empty database: %+v", first.stats)
	}
	if _, err := first.m.Edit(ctx, cornerEdits()); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("corner edit: %v", err)
	}
	if _, err := first.m.Edit(ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 10, GY: 10, Height: 5000, Material: 2}, {GX: 140, GY: 100, Height: 6000, Material: 4}}); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("second edit: %v", err)
	}
	before := snapshotTerrain(first.m)
	first.stop(t)

	// 库里就是改过的那 5 块（(0,0) 两次、(2,1) 一次、另外三块各一次），没有别的块。
	count, err := client.Database(physical).Collection(db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection).CountDocuments(ctx, map[string]any{})
	if err != nil || count != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("%d chunk documents in Mongo (%v), want 5", count, err)
	}

	second := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack)
	if second.stats.Overlays != 5 || second.stats.Base != 1 || second.stats.StaleBase != 0 || second.stats.Corrupt != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("restart: %+v, want 5 overlays and 1 chunk from the pack", second.stats)
	}
	after := snapshotTerrain(second.m)
	if !maps.Equal(before.versions, after.versions) {
		t.Fatalf("versions before the restart %v, after %v", before.versions, after.versions)
	}
	for i := range before.ground {
		if before.ground[i] != after.ground[i] || before.errs[i] != after.errs[i] {
			t.Fatalf("point %d: before the restart %+v (%q), after %+v (%q)", i, before.ground[i], before.errs[i], after.ground[i], after.errs[i])
		}
	}
	t.Logf("real Mongo restart: %d points and %d chunk versions identical; versions %v; load %+v", len(after.ground), len(after.versions), after.versions, second.stats)
	versions, err := second.m.Edit(ctx, []terrainmap.SampleEdit{{GX: 1, GY: 1, Height: 9, Material: 9}})
	if err != nil || versions[terrain.ChunkKey{}] != 3 {
		t.Fatalf("edit after the restart: %v, %v (want version 3)", versions, err)
	}
	if h := sampleHeight(t, second.m, 1, 1); h != second.m.Meta().WorldHeight(9) {
		t.Fatalf("height after the post-restart edit: %d", h)
	}
	// 停机排空投影后，库里 (0,0) 的记录就是重启后那一笔：Version 3、改过的点在。
	second.stop(t)
	var stored struct {
		Version int64   `bson:"2"`
		Heights []int32 `bson:"3"`
	}
	if err := client.Database(physical).Collection(db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection).FindOne(ctx, map[string]any{"_id": mustChunkID(t, terrain.ChunkKey{})}, &stored); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if stored.Version != 3 || len(stored.Heights) != terrain.ChunkPoints || stored.Heights[1*terrain.ChunkSamples+1] != 9 {
		t.Fatalf("stored chunk (0,0): version %d, %d heights, height at (1,1) %v", stored.Version, len(stored.Heights), stored.Heights[1*terrain.ChunkSamples+1])
	}

	// 原始地形换版（包换成 BaseRevision 2）：5 块的改动经真实 DataEngine 丢弃（冷加载 + strict 事务 → WAL → 投影），
	// 库里留下 Version 0 的空记录，重启后全部按新包的原始块装入、不再丢弃。
	pack2 := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 2)
	third := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack2)
	if third.stats.Discarded != 5 || third.stats.StaleBase != 0 || third.stats.Overlays != 0 || third.stats.Base != 6 {
		t.Fatalf("start on revision 2: %+v, want the 5 edited chunks discarded and every chunk from the pack", third.stats)
	}
	third.stop(t)
	stored.Version, stored.Heights = -1, nil
	if err := client.Database(physical).Collection(db.TerrainChunkDaoCollection).FindOne(ctx, map[string]any{"_id": mustChunkID(t, terrain.ChunkKey{})}, &stored); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if stored.Version != 0 || len(stored.Heights) != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("stored chunk (0,0) after the discard: version %d, %d heights; want an empty version-0 record", stored.Version, len(stored.Heights))
	}
	fourth := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack2)
	if fourth.stats.Discarded != 0 || fourth.stats.StaleBase != 0 || fourth.stats.Base != 6 {
		t.Fatalf("restart on revision 2 after the discard: %+v", fourth.stats)
	}
	fourth.stop(t)
}

// 真实 Mongo 上的编辑账本（T01/T02）：序号 1～70 在块 (0,0) 上各执行一次（strict 事务 → WAL → 投影），正常停机后库里
// 恰有这个玩家的一份账本（LastSeq 70、下面 64 位全为 1）；重启后（账本冷加载）重放 1 与 5 答 ErrStale、6 与 70 答
// Duplicate，块的版本不变、库里的账本不变；新序号 71 照常生效。门变量同 TestTerrainRestartRealMongo。
func TestTerrainEditLedgerRealMongo(t *testing.T) {
	uri := os.Getenv("ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI")
	if uri == "" {
		t.Skip("ROOST_TERRAIN_IT_MONGO_URI not set")
	}
	ctx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 3*time.Minute)
	defer cancel()
	client, err := mongodriver.NewClient(fmongo.DefaultConfig(uri), mongodriver.IndexMigrationPolicy{})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	t.Cleanup(func() { _ = client.Close(context.Background()) })
	physical := fmt.Sprintf("terrain_ledger_it_%d", time.Now().UnixNano())
	t.Cleanup(func() { _ = client.Database(physical).Drop(context.Background()) })
	databases, _, err := coredata.NewDatabaseMap(coredata.DatabaseMapConfig{
		Declared: coredata.DeclaredDatabases(), Configured: map[string]string{db.TerrainChunkDaoDBName: physical},
	})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	dir := t.TempDir()
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, dir, 1)
	walDir := filepath.Join(dir, "wal")
	unlimited := func(p *realTerrainProcess) {
		policy := terrainmap.DefaultPolicy
		policy.EditPointsPerSecond = 0
		p.m.SetPolicy(policy)
	}
	paint := func(seq uint64) terrain.Brush {
		return terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 300, Material: byte(seq)}
	}

	first := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack)
	unlimited(first)
	for seq := uint64(1); seq <= 70; seq++ {
		if r, err := first.m.Brush(ctx, brushPlayer, seq, paint(seq)); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != int64(seq) {
			t.Fatalf("sequence %d: %+v, %v", seq, r, err)
		}
	}
	first.stop(t)
	type storedLedger struct {
		LastSeq int64 `bson:"1"`
		Window  int64 `bson:"2"`
	}
	ledgerID, err := terrain_editor.EntityID(brushPlayer)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	readLedger := func() storedLedger {
		t.Helper()
		var stored storedLedger
		if err := client.Database(physical).Collection(db.TerrainEditorDaoCollection).FindOne(ctx, map[string]any{"_id": ledgerID}, &stored); err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
		return stored
	}
	count, err := client.Database(physical).Collection(db.TerrainEditorDaoCollection).CountDocuments(ctx, map[string]any{})
	if err != nil || count != 1 {
		t.Fatalf("%d ledger documents in Mongo (%v), want 1", count, err)
	}
	want := storedLedger{LastSeq: 70, Window: -1}
	if got := readLedger(); got != want {
		t.Fatalf("stored ledger %+v, want %+v (all 64 bits below 70 set)", got, want)
	}

	second := startRealTerrainProcess(t, ctx, client, databases, physical, walDir, pack)
	unlimited(second)
	version, _ := second.m.View().Version(terrain.ChunkKey{})
	if version != 70 {
		t.Fatalf("chunk (0,0) version %d after the restart, want 70", version)
	}
	for _, c := range []struct {
		seq   uint64
		stale bool
	}{{1, true}, {5, true}, {6, false}, {70, false}} {
		r, err := second.m.Brush(ctx, brushPlayer, c.seq, paint(c.seq))
		if c.stale && !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrStale) || !c.stale && (err != nil || !r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != 70) {
			t.Fatalf("replay of %d after a restart on real Mongo: %+v, %v (stale expected: %v)", c.seq, r, err, c.stale)
		}
	}
	if v, _ := second.m.View().Version(terrain.ChunkKey{}); v != 70 {
		t.Fatalf("chunk (0,0) version %d after the replays, want 70", v)
	}
	if r, err := second.m.Brush(ctx, brushPlayer, 71, paint(71)); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != 71 || r.Chunks[0].Version != 71 {
		t.Fatalf("a new sequence after the restart: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
	second.stop(t)
	if got := readLedger(); got != (storedLedger{LastSeq: 71, Window: -1}) {
		t.Fatalf("stored ledger after sequence 71: %+v", got)
	}
}

// ---- 玩家编辑（P2：笔刷、校验、幂等、多块事务） ----

// brushProcess 是只有地形的一个进程，玩家编辑不限频（限速另有用例），时钟固定。
func brushProcess(t *testing.T, store *memoryChunkStore) *terrainProcess {
	t.Helper()
	return startTerrainProcessWith(t, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), wholeMap, store, func(p *terrainProcess) {
		policy := terrainmap.DefaultPolicy
		policy.EditPointsPerSecond = 0
		p.m.SetPolicy(policy)
	})
}

// chunkState 是一块在实体与视图里的全部状态：DAO 的版本、高度与材质，视图的版本与数据。
type chunkState struct {
	daoVersion   int64
	heights      []uint16
	materials    []uint16
	viewVersion  int64
	viewHeights  []uint16
	viewMaterial []byte
}

func stateOf(t *testing.T, p *terrainProcess, key terrain.ChunkKey) chunkState {
	t.Helper()
	var s chunkState
	if e, _ := p.entities.Get(mustChunkID(t, key)).(*terrain_chunk.TerrainChunk); e != nil {
		dao := e.Dao()
		s.daoVersion = dao.GetVersion()
		dao.RangeHeights(func(_ int, v uint16) bool { s.heights = append(s.heights, v); return true })
		dao.RangeMaterials(func(_ int, v uint16) bool { s.materials = append(s.materials, v); return true })
	}
	// 没有实体与 Version 0 的空实体等价：第一次改的块在事务之前 GetOrCreate，事务回滚后留下的空实体仍按原始块看待。
	c, v, _ := p.m.View().Chunk(key)
	s.viewVersion, s.viewHeights, s.viewMaterial = v, c.Heights, c.Materials
	return s
}

func sameState(a, b chunkState) bool {
	return a.daoVersion == b.daoVersion && slices.Equal(a.heights, b.heights) && slices.Equal(a.materials, b.materials) &&
		a.viewVersion == b.viewVersion && slices.Equal(a.viewHeights, b.viewHeights) &&
		slices.Equal(a.viewMaterial, b.viewMaterial)
}

func allStates(t *testing.T, p *terrainProcess) map[terrain.ChunkKey]chunkState {
	t.Helper()
	out := map[terrain.ChunkKey]chunkState{}
	for _, key := range p.m.Keys() {
		out[key] = stateOf(t, p, key)
	}
	return out
}

func sameStates(a, b map[terrain.ChunkKey]chunkState) bool {
	return maps.EqualFunc(a, b, sameState)
}

// editorPlayers 是这些测试里会编辑的玩家：persist 为他们的编辑账本编文档。
var editorPlayers = []int64{brushPlayer, brushPlayer + 1}

// ledgerOf 是玩家编辑账本的当前值；没有账本实体（从没编辑过）时是零值。
func ledgerOf(t *testing.T, p *terrainProcess, player int64) terrain_editor.SeqWindow {
	t.Helper()
	id, err := terrain_editor.EntityID(player)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if e, _ := p.entities.Get(id).(*terrain_editor.TerrainEditor); e != nil {
		return e.LedgerComp().Window()
	}
	return terrain_editor.SeqWindow{}
}

// expectBrushes 是在原始块上依次应用笔刷（纯函数，限值同 DefaultPolicy）后每块的期望数据。
func expectBrushes(t *testing.T, m *terrainmap.Map, pack string, brushes ...terrain.Brush) map[terrain.ChunkKey]terrain.Chunk {
	t.Helper()
	p, err := terrain.OpenPack(pack)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	defer p.Close()
	chunks := map[terrain.ChunkKey]terrain.Chunk{}
	for _, key := range m.Keys() {
		if chunks[key], err = p.ReadChunk(key); err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
	}
	for _, b := range brushes {
		changes, err := b.Apply(m.Meta(), m.Policy().Limits, chunks)
		if err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
		for _, change := range changes {
			for _, pt := range change.Points {
				chunks[change.Key].Heights[pt.Index], chunks[change.Key].Materials[pt.Index] = pt.Height, pt.Material
			}
		}
	}
	return chunks
}

func viewMatches(t *testing.T, m *terrainmap.Map, want map[terrain.ChunkKey]terrain.Chunk) {
	t.Helper()
	for key, chunk := range want {
		got, _, _ := m.View().Chunk(key)
		if !slices.Equal(got.Heights, chunk.Heights) || !slices.Equal(got.Materials, chunk.Materials) {
			t.Fatalf("chunk %v in the view differs from the brushes applied once each in order", key)
		}
	}
}

const brushPlayer = int64(4242)

// 重复与乱序（方案 §9 P2）：同一请求重发得到 Duplicate、什么都不写；先到的序号 3、后到的序号 2 各生效一次（按到达
// 顺序，窗口内的乱序），之后两者的重放都是 Duplicate；结果与“按到达顺序各应用一次”的纯计算逐点相同。四块交点上的
// 笔刷在一笔事务里改 4 块，序号记进玩家的账本。
func TestTerrainBrushRepeatsAndReordersApplyOnce(t *testing.T) {
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	p := brushProcess(t, store)
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1)
	corner := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: terrain.ChunkSize, Radius: 1200, Falloff: terrain.FalloffLinear, Strength: 40}
	paint := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: terrain.ChunkSize + 300, Y: terrain.ChunkSize - 200, Radius: 500, Material: 77}
	lower := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushLower, X: 3000, Y: 3000, Radius: 800, Falloff: terrain.FalloffSmooth, Strength: 20}

	result, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, corner)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if result.Duplicate || len(result.Chunks) != 4 {
		t.Fatalf("corner brush: %+v, want 4 chunks", result)
	}
	for _, c := range result.Chunks {
		if c.Version != 1 {
			t.Fatalf("corner brush left %v at version %d", c.Key, c.Version)
		}
	}
	commits := p.committer.commits.Load()
	before := allStates(t, p)
	again, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, corner)
	if err != nil || !again.Duplicate || !slices.Equal(again.Chunks, result.Chunks) {
		t.Fatalf("the same request again: %+v, %v; want Duplicate with the same versions", again, err)
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) {
		t.Fatal("a duplicate request changed a chunk")
	}
	// 不同玩家的同一个请求 ID 是另一次编辑。
	if other, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer+1, 1, paint); err != nil || other.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("another player's request 1: %+v, %v", other, err)
	}
	// 乱序：3 先到、2 后到，各生效一次；重放都不再生效。
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 3, lower); err != nil || r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("request 3: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, corner); err != nil || r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("request 2 after 3: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
	settled := allStates(t, p)
	for _, id := range []uint64{3, 2, 1} {
		brush := map[uint64]terrain.Brush{1: corner, 2: corner, 3: lower}[id]
		if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, id, brush); err != nil || !r.Duplicate {
			t.Fatalf("replay of request %d: %+v, %v; want Duplicate", id, r, err)
		}
	}
	if !sameStates(settled, allStates(t, p)) {
		t.Fatal("a replay changed a chunk")
	}
	viewMatches(t, p.m, expectBrushes(t, p.m, pack, corner, paint, lower, corner))
	if commits == 0 || p.m.CommitFailures() != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("commits %d, commit failures %d", commits, p.m.CommitFailures())
	}
	// 序号记在玩家的账本里（与改块同一笔事务）：最大 3，下面 1、2 都已应用；另一个玩家有自己的账本。
	if got := ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer); got != (terrain_editor.SeqWindow{Last: 3, Bits: 0b11}) {
		t.Fatalf("ledger of player %d: %+v, want last 3 with 2 and 1 applied", brushPlayer, got)
	}
	if got := ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer+1); got != (terrain_editor.SeqWindow{Last: 1}) {
		t.Fatalf("ledger of player %d: %+v, want last 1", brushPlayer+1, got)
	}

	// 重启之后重放仍然是 Duplicate（账本持久）。
	p.stop()
	p.persist(store)
	restarted := startTerrainProcessWith(t, pack, wholeMap, store, func(q *terrainProcess) { q.m.SetPolicy(p.m.Policy()) })
	if r, err := restarted.m.Brush(restarted.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, corner); err != nil || !r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("replay of request 2 after a restart: %+v, %v; want Duplicate", r, err)
	}
	viewMatches(t, restarted.m, expectBrushes(t, restarted.m, pack, corner, paint, lower, corner))
}

// T01：窗口之外的旧请求重放不再执行。序号 1 抬高之后同一块上又做了 100 次编辑（2～101），重放 1：账本只记得
// [37, 101]，1 低于窗口，答 ErrStale（带 LastSeq 101），块、视图、账本、提交数都不变；窗口两端（37 在内、36 在外）按
// 规则答 Duplicate / ErrStale。重启后（账本从库里读回）同样：重放 1 与 36 是 ErrStale、37 与 101 是 Duplicate，什么都
// 不写；新序号 102 照常生效。修复前（块上 32 个编辑 ID 的环）重放 1 会被再执行一次（Version 41 → 42）。
func TestTerrainBrushReplayBelowTheWindowIsStale(t *testing.T) {
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	p := brushProcess(t, store)
	first := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Strength: 10}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, first); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	later := func(seq uint64) terrain.Brush {
		return terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 300, Material: byte(seq)}
	}
	for seq := uint64(2); seq <= 101; seq++ {
		if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, seq, later(seq)); err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
	}
	replays := func(p *terrainProcess, when string) {
		t.Helper()
		before, ledger, commits := allStates(t, p), ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer), p.committer.commits.Load()
		for _, c := range []struct {
			seq   uint64
			stale bool
		}{{1, true}, {36, true}, {37, false}, {100, false}, {101, false}} {
			b := later(c.seq)
			if c.seq == 1 {
				b = first
			}
			r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, c.seq, b)
			var seqErr *terrainmap.SeqError
			switch {
			case c.stale && (!errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrStale) || !errors.As(err, &seqErr) || seqErr.LastSeq != 101):
				t.Fatalf("%s: replay of %d: %+v, %v; want ErrStale with LastSeq 101", when, c.seq, r, err)
			case !c.stale && (err != nil || !r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != 101):
				t.Fatalf("%s: replay of %d: %+v, %v; want Duplicate with LastSeq 101", when, c.seq, r, err)
			}
		}
		if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) || ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer) != ledger || p.committer.commits.Load() != commits {
			t.Fatalf("%s: a replay wrote something (ledger %+v → %+v, commits %d → %d)", when, ledger, ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer), commits, p.committer.commits.Load())
		}
	}
	replays(p, "before the restart")
	want := ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer)
	if want.Last != 101 || want.Bits != ^uint64(0) {
		t.Fatalf("ledger after 101 edits in order: %+v, want last 101 with all 64 below applied", want)
	}

	p.stop()
	p.persist(store)
	q := brushProcess(t, store)
	if got := ledgerOf(t, q, brushPlayer); got != want {
		t.Fatalf("ledger after a restart: %+v, want %+v", got, want)
	}
	replays(q, "after a restart")
	if r, err := q.m.Brush(q.ctx, brushPlayer, 102, later(102)); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != 102 {
		t.Fatalf("a new sequence after the restart: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
}

// legacyEditID 是修复前的编辑 ID（T02）：splitmix64(playerID ⊕ splitmix64(requestID)) 截成 63 位。只用来构造当时会碰撞
// 的两个请求。
func legacyEditID(playerID int64, requestID uint64) uint64 {
	return legacyMix(uint64(playerID)^legacyMix(requestID)) &^ (1 << 63)
}

func legacyMix(x uint64) uint64 {
	x += 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15
	x = (x ^ (x >> 30)) * 0xBF58476D1CE4E5B9
	x = (x ^ (x >> 27)) * 0x94D049BB133111EB
	return x ^ (x >> 31)
}

// legacyUnmix 是 legacyMix 的逆（splitmix64 是 2^64 上的双射）：xorshift 的逆与奇数乘子的模逆。
func legacyUnmix(x uint64) uint64 {
	unshift := func(x uint64, s uint) uint64 {
		out := x
		for shift := s; shift < 64; shift += s {
			out ^= x >> shift
		}
		return out
	}
	inverse := func(a uint64) uint64 {
		x := a
		for range 6 {
			x *= 2 - a*x
		}
		return x
	}
	x = unshift(x, 31)
	x *= inverse(0x94D049BB133111EB)
	x = unshift(x, 27)
	x *= inverse(0xBF58476D1CE4E5B9)
	x = unshift(x, 30)
	return x - 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15
}

// collidingPlayers 构造两个合法玩家（1～entity.UniqueIDMask），他们各自的序号 1 在修复前得到同一个编辑 ID：选 p1，
// 让 p2 的 splitmix64 全值只与 p1 的差最高位（截成 63 位后相同），逆推出 p2；p2 落在合法范围的概率约 2^-12，逐个试 p1。
func collidingPlayers(t *testing.T) (int64, int64) {
	t.Helper()
	inner := legacyMix(1)
	for p1 := int64(1); p1 < 1<<24; p1++ {
		full := legacyMix(uint64(p1) ^ inner)
		p2 := int64(legacyUnmix(full^(1<<63)) ^ inner)
		if p2 <= 0 || uint64(p2) > entity.UniqueIDMask {
			continue
		}
		if legacyEditID(p1, 1) != legacyEditID(p2, 1) {
			t.Fatalf("construction: players %d and %d do not share an edit id", p1, p2)
		}
		return p1, p2
	}
	t.Fatal("no colliding pair of players")
	return 0, 0
}

// T02：修复前截成 63 位的编辑 ID 会碰撞，后到的那个合法请求被当成重复、不执行。构造两个合法玩家，他们的序号 1 在
// 旧算法下编辑 ID 相同、编辑同一块：现在身份是（玩家, 序号）原样比较，两次都执行（各自 Version + 1），各自的重试只得到
// Duplicate、不再写；两人的账本各记各的。
func TestTerrainBrushRequestsThatSharedATruncatedIDBothApply(t *testing.T) {
	p := brushProcess(t, &memoryChunkStore{})
	p1, p2 := collidingPlayers(t)
	t.Logf("players %d and %d: sequence 1 had the same truncated edit id %d", p1, p2, legacyEditID(p1, 1))
	raise := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Strength: 10}
	paint := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Material: 99}
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, p1, 1, raise); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.Chunks[0].Version != 1 {
		t.Fatalf("player %d sequence 1: %+v, %v", p1, r, err)
	}
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, p2, 1, paint); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.Chunks[0].Version != 2 {
		t.Fatalf("player %d sequence 1 (shared the old edit id): %+v, %v; want it applied (version 2)", p2, r, err)
	}
	before, commits := allStates(t, p), p.committer.commits.Load()
	for _, c := range []struct {
		player int64
		b      terrain.Brush
	}{{p1, raise}, {p2, paint}, {p1, raise}} {
		if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, c.player, 1, c.b); err != nil || !r.Duplicate || r.Chunks[0].Version != 2 {
			t.Fatalf("player %d retries sequence 1: %+v, %v; want Duplicate at version 2", c.player, r, err)
		}
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) || p.committer.commits.Load() != commits {
		t.Fatal("a retry changed a chunk")
	}
	viewMatches(t, p.m, expectBrushes(t, p.m, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), raise, paint))
	for _, player := range []int64{p1, p2} {
		if got := ledgerOf(t, p, player); got != (terrain_editor.SeqWindow{Last: 1}) {
			t.Fatalf("ledger of player %d: %+v", player, got)
		}
	}
}

// 续号查询（协议 Seq = 0）：没编辑过的玩家是 0；编辑后是已应用的最大序号（乱序时也是最大的那个）；重启后从库里读回。
func TestTerrainLastSeqTellsAClientWhereToContinue(t *testing.T) {
	store := &memoryChunkStore{}
	p := brushProcess(t, store)
	if last, err := p.m.LastSeq(p.ctx, brushPlayer); err != nil || last != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("a player who never edited: %d, %v", last, err)
	}
	for _, seq := range []uint64{1, 5, 3} {
		if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, seq, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 300, Material: byte(seq)}); err != nil {
			t.Fatal(err)
		}
	}
	if last, err := p.m.LastSeq(p.ctx, brushPlayer); err != nil || last != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("after 1, 5, 3: %d, %v; want 5", last, err)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.LastSeq(p.ctx, 0); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrBrush) {
		t.Fatalf("player 0: %v, want ErrBrush", err)
	}
	p.stop()
	p.persist(store)
	q := brushProcess(t, store)
	if last, err := q.m.LastSeq(q.ctx, brushPlayer); err != nil || last != 5 {
		t.Fatalf("after a restart: %d, %v; want 5", last, err)
	}
}

// 拒绝时零写入：每种拒绝之后实体、视图、玩家的编辑账本与提交数都不变（拒绝的请求不记序号，同一序号之后仍可用）。
func TestTerrainBrushRefusalsWriteNothing(t *testing.T) {
	p := brushProcess(t, &memoryChunkStore{})
	ok := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Strength: 10}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, ok); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	rules := &brushRules{}
	p.m.SetRules(rules)
	cases := []struct {
		name  string
		setup func()
		req   uint64
		b     terrain.Brush
		want  error
	}{
		{"sequence 0", nil, 0, ok, terrainmap.ErrBrush},
		{"sequence over 2^63-1", nil, math.MaxInt64 + 1, ok, terrainmap.ErrBrush},
		{"sequence too far ahead of the ledger", nil, 1 + terrain_editor.MaxSeqAhead + 1, ok, terrainmap.ErrSeqAhead},
		{"no op", nil, 10, terrain.Brush{X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500}, terrain.ErrInvalidBrush},
		{"radius over 16m", nil, 11, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 1601}, terrainmap.ErrBrush},
		{"strength over 5m", nil, 12, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Strength: 51}, terrainmap.ErrBrush},
		{"flatten above the ceiling", nil, 13, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushFlatten, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Target: 16384}, terrain.ErrInvalidBrush},
		{"centre off the map", nil, 14, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: -5, Y: 3200, Radius: 500}, terrain.ErrOutOfMap},
		{"no sample covered", nil, 15, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 150, Y: 150, Radius: 10}, terrainmap.ErrBrush},
		{"territory hook", func() { rules.deny = true }, 16, ok, terrainmap.ErrDenied},
		{"a building under the brush", func() { rules.deny, rules.occupied = false, true }, 17, ok, terrainmap.ErrOccupied},
	}
	for _, tc := range cases {
		if tc.setup != nil {
			tc.setup()
		}
		before, ledger, commits := allStates(t, p), ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer), p.committer.commits.Load()
		if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, tc.req, tc.b); !errors.Is(err, tc.want) {
			t.Fatalf("%s: %v, want %v", tc.name, err, tc.want)
		}
		if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) || ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer) != ledger || p.committer.commits.Load() != commits {
			t.Fatalf("%s: a refused brush wrote something", tc.name)
		}
	}
	rules.occupied = false
	// 拒绝过的序号没有记下：用其中一个做下一次编辑照常生效。
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 17, ok); err != nil || r.Duplicate || r.LastSeq != 17 {
		t.Fatalf("sequence 17 after its refusal: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
	// 不归本进程写的块：只写块 (0,0) 的进程上，跨到 (1,0) 的笔刷整笔拒绝。
	own00 := startTerrainProcess(t, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), func(meta terrain.Meta) (terrainmap.Region, error) {
		return terrainmap.Region{Own: terrain.ChunkKey{}.Bounds(), Load: meta.Bounds()}, nil
	}, &memoryChunkStore{})
	before := allStates(t, own00)
	if _, err := own00.m.Brush(own00.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: terrain.ChunkSize - 100, Y: 3200, Radius: 500}); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrNotOwned) {
		t.Fatalf("a brush across into another cell's chunk: %v, want ErrNotOwned", err)
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, own00)) {
		t.Fatal("a brush refused for ownership wrote something")
	}
}

type brushRules struct{ deny, occupied bool }

func (r *brushRules) AllowEdit(context.Context, int64, terrain.Brush, []terrain.ChunkKey) error {
	if r.deny {
		return errors.New("not your land")
	}
	return nil
}

func (r *brushRules) Occupied(terrain.ChunkKey, int32) bool { return r.occupied }

// ---- 每玩家改动点数配额（维护者 2026-11-08：每人每秒 270 点，取代每秒 2 次） ----

// quotaProcess 是缺省 Policy（配额 270 点 / 秒、每次至少 20 点）、时钟由测试拨动的进程。
func quotaProcess(t *testing.T, edit func(*terrainmap.Policy)) (*terrainProcess, *time.Time) {
	t.Helper()
	now := time.Unix(1_800_000_000, 0)
	p := startTerrainProcessWith(t, writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1), wholeMap, &memoryChunkStore{}, func(p *terrainProcess) {
		policy := terrainmap.DefaultPolicy
		if edit != nil {
			edit(&policy)
		}
		p.m.SetPolicy(policy)
		p.m.SetClock(func() time.Time { return now })
	})
	if got := p.m.Policy(); got.EditPointsPerSecond != 270 || got.MinEditPoints != 20 {
		t.Fatalf("policy %+v, want 270 points a second and at least 20 an edit", got)
	}
	return p, &now
}

// changedPoints 是笔刷在视图当前数据上会改变的高度点数与材质点数，按 Apply 的结果逐点比较数出（与 Map 计配额用的
// View.BrushChanges 是两条独立的路径）。
func changedPoints(t *testing.T, m *terrainmap.Map, b terrain.Brush) (heights, materials int) {
	t.Helper()
	chunks := map[terrain.ChunkKey]terrain.Chunk{}
	for _, key := range b.Chunks(m.Meta()) {
		c, _, loaded := m.View().Chunk(key)
		if !loaded {
			t.Fatalf("chunk %v not loaded", key)
		}
		chunks[key] = c
	}
	changes, err := b.Apply(m.Meta(), m.Policy().Limits, chunks)
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	for _, change := range changes {
		for _, pt := range change.Points {
			if pt.Height != chunks[change.Key].Heights[pt.Index] {
				heights++
			}
			if pt.Material != chunks[change.Key].Materials[pt.Index] {
				materials++
			}
		}
	}
	return heights, materials
}

// refusedWithoutWriting 断言这次编辑因配额被拒、什么都没写：实体、Applied、视图、提交数都不变，覆盖到的没改过的块
// 也没有建实体。
func refusedWithoutWriting(t *testing.T, p *terrainProcess, request uint64, b terrain.Brush, what string) {
	t.Helper()
	before, commits := allStates(t, p), p.committer.commits.Load()
	var absent []int64
	for _, key := range b.Chunks(p.m.Meta()) {
		if id := mustChunkID(t, key); p.entities.Get(id) == nil {
			absent = append(absent, id)
		}
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, request, b); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrRateLimited) {
		t.Fatalf("%s: %v, want ErrRateLimited", what, err)
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) || p.committer.commits.Load() != commits {
		t.Fatalf("%s: an edit refused for its quota wrote something", what)
	}
	for _, id := range absent {
		if p.entities.Get(id) != nil {
			t.Fatalf("%s: an edit refused for its quota created chunk entity %d", what, id)
		}
	}
}

// admittedAfter 把时钟拨到“余额 left 补到 need”前 1ms：这次编辑被拒（差 0.27 点）；再拨 2ms：被接受（余额 need + 0.27）。
// 用来按配额的边界逐点钉住之前扣了多少（时钟是测试的，补充按 270 点 / 秒精确）。need 是这次编辑的点数，透支时是 270。
func admittedAfter(t *testing.T, p *terrainProcess, now *time.Time, left, need float64, request uint64, b terrain.Brush, what string) {
	t.Helper()
	wait := time.Duration((need - left) / 270 * float64(time.Second))
	*now = now.Add(wait - time.Millisecond)
	refusedWithoutWriting(t, p, request, b, what+" (0.27 points short)")
	*now = now.Add(2 * time.Millisecond)
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, request, b); err != nil || r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("%s once the quota is back: %+v, %v", what, r, err)
	}
}

// 计数口径：按字段计实际会改变的点（改材质只计材质、抬高只计高度，值没变的不计；四块交点的共享边点只计一次），每次
// 至少 20 点。满桶 270：改材质 81 + 抬高 81 + 刷成同一种材质（0 点，按 20 计）后余 88；四块交点改材质 177 点不够、
// 整笔拒绝零写入（交点上没改过的块也不建实体）；等补到差 0.27 点仍拒，补够即通过。别的玩家有自己的桶。
func TestTerrainBrushQuotaCountsTheChangedPointsOfEachField(t *testing.T) {
	p, now := quotaProcess(t, nil)
	spot := terrain.ChunkKey{}.Origin()
	spot.X, spot.Y = spot.X+3200, spot.Y+3200
	paint := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: spot.X, Y: spot.Y, Radius: 500, Material: 201}
	raise := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: spot.X, Y: spot.Y, Radius: 500, Strength: 10}
	corner := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: terrain.ChunkSize, Radius: 750, Material: 202}

	if h, m := changedPoints(t, p.m, paint); h != 0 || m != 81 {
		t.Fatalf("an r=5m paint changes %d heights / %d materials, want 0 / 81", h, m)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, paint); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if h, m := changedPoints(t, p.m, raise); h != 81 || m != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("an r=5m constant raise changes %d heights / %d materials, want 81 / 0", h, m)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, raise); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	// 同一处再刷一遍同一种材质：没有点会变，按下限 20 计；提交了（Applied 记下请求），数据不变。
	if h, m := changedPoints(t, p.m, paint); h != 0 || m != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("painting the same material again changes %d / %d points, want none", h, m)
	}
	before, commits := stateOf(t, p, terrain.ChunkKey{}), p.committer.commits.Load()
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 3, paint); err != nil || r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("a no-op paint: %+v, %v", r, err)
	}
	if after := stateOf(t, p, terrain.ChunkKey{}); p.committer.commits.Load() == commits || !slices.Equal(after.heights, before.heights) || !slices.Equal(after.materials, before.materials) {
		t.Fatal("a no-op paint should commit (record its request) and change no point")
	}
	// 余 270 − 81 − 81 − 20 = 88。交点改材质：每个采样点只属于一块，177 点。
	if h, m := changedPoints(t, p.m, corner); h != 0 || m != 177 {
		t.Fatalf("a corner paint changes %d / %d points, want 0 / 177 (each sample point once)", h, m)
	}
	refusedWithoutWriting(t, p, 4, corner, "a 177-point edit with 88 left")
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer+1, 1, corner); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("another player's full bucket: %v", err)
	}
	// 别的玩家刚把交点刷成了 202，换一种材质（仍是 177 点）。
	corner.Material = 203
	admittedAfter(t, p, now, 88, 177, 4, corner, "the corner paint")
}

// 单次超过桶上限：满桶时放行一次（透支成负数），之后要补回到满才能再透支、补够才能做小编辑。玩家 r=16m 抬高约 800
// 点、运维放大半径后的整平 r=24m（守卫，约 1800 点）都适用；长期平均不超过每秒 270 点。
func TestTerrainBrushQuotaLetsAFullBucketOverdrawOnce(t *testing.T) {
	p, now := quotaProcess(t, func(policy *terrainmap.Policy) { policy.MaxRadius = 2500 })
	big := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: terrain.ChunkSize + 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 1600, Falloff: terrain.FalloffSmooth, Strength: 40}
	small := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: 2 * terrain.ChunkSize + 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 300, Material: 99}
	bigCost, _ := changedPoints(t, p.m, big)
	if bigCost <= 270 {
		t.Fatalf("an r=16m raise changes %d points, want more than the 270 a bucket holds", bigCost)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, big); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("an r=16m raise (%d points) on a full bucket: %v", bigCost, err)
	}
	_, smallCost := changedPoints(t, p.m, small)
	smallCost = max(smallCost, 20)
	// 余额 270 − bigCost < 0：小编辑要等补到 smallCost。
	admittedAfter(t, p, now, float64(270-bigCost), float64(smallCost), 2, small, "a small edit after the overdraft")
	// 余 0.27。不满的桶不能透支：r=16m 要等补满 270。
	big.Strength = 30
	refusedWithoutWriting(t, p, 3, big, "a second big edit on a bucket that is not full")
	admittedAfter(t, p, now, 0.27, 270, 3, big, "a second big edit once the bucket is full")
	// 地基这类大操作（整平 r=24m，超过高度守卫）同样：满桶放行一次。
	*now = now.Add(time.Hour)
	flatten := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushFlatten, X: terrain.ChunkSize + 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 2400, Target: 1500}
	if h, _ := changedPoints(t, p.m, flatten); h <= 1000 {
		t.Fatalf("an r=24m flatten changes %d heights, want more than the guard", h)
	}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 4, flatten); err != nil {
		t.Fatalf("an r=24m flatten on a full bucket: %v", err)
	}
	refusedWithoutWriting(t, p, 5, small, "a small edit right after the flatten")
}

// 重复请求与确定没改的拒绝只计下限 20 点：重放一次大编辑不被扣两遍；领地钩子拒绝、建筑占位（事务里回滚）、序号跳得
// 太远（账本在事务里拒绝）也一样。用配额的边界钉住：满桶 270，抬高 81 后余 189；重放（−20）余 169；领地拒绝（−20）
// 余 149；占位拒绝（−20）余 129；序号越界（−20）余 109；交点改材质 177 点不够，等补到 177 才通过。重放若按 81 计，
// 这里会差 61 点。
func TestTerrainBrushQuotaChargesRepeatsAndRefusalsTheMinimum(t *testing.T) {
	p, now := quotaProcess(t, nil)
	rules := &brushRules{}
	p.m.SetRules(rules)
	raise := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushRaise, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 500, Strength: 10}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, raise); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	before := allStates(t, p)
	if r, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, raise); err != nil || !r.Duplicate {
		t.Fatalf("the same request again: %+v, %v; want Duplicate", r, err)
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) {
		t.Fatal("a duplicate request changed a chunk")
	}
	rules.deny = true
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, raise); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrDenied) {
		t.Fatalf("territory hook: %v, want ErrDenied", err)
	}
	rules.deny, rules.occupied = false, true
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 3, raise); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrOccupied) {
		t.Fatalf("a building under the brush: %v, want ErrOccupied", err)
	}
	rules.occupied = false
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2+terrain_editor.MaxSeqAhead, raise); !errors.Is(err, terrainmap.ErrSeqAhead) {
		t.Fatalf("a sequence far ahead: %v, want ErrSeqAhead", err)
	}
	if !sameStates(before, allStates(t, p)) {
		t.Fatal("a refused edit changed a chunk")
	}
	corner := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: terrain.ChunkSize, Radius: 750, Material: 202}
	if _, m := changedPoints(t, p.m, corner); m != 177 {
		t.Fatalf("a corner paint changes %d materials, want 177", m)
	}
	admittedAfter(t, p, now, 109, 177, 4, corner, "the corner paint")
}

// 多块事务回滚（方案 §9 P2）：跨四块（两块改过、两块第一次改）的一笔编辑被提交器拒绝时，四块的实体（版本、数据）、
// 视图与玩家的编辑账本全都不变；用同一序号重试则生效（序号也随回滚撤销了，不会被当成重复）。
func TestTerrainBrushRollbackLeavesEveryChunkAndTheView(t *testing.T) {
	p := brushProcess(t, &memoryChunkStore{})
	// 先改 (0,0) 与 (1,0)，(0,1)、(1,1) 还是原始块。
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushPaint, X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: 3200, Radius: 400, Material: 5}); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	before, ledger := allStates(t, p), ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer)
	corner := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushFlatten, X: terrain.ChunkSize, Y: terrain.ChunkSize, Radius: 1500, Falloff: terrain.FalloffSmooth, Target: 2000}
	p.committer.reject.Store(true)
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, corner); !errors.Is(err, nest.ErrCommitRejected) || !errors.Is(err, errInjectedRejection) {
		t.Fatalf("rejected corner brush: %v, want ErrCommitRejected", err)
	}
	after := allStates(t, p)
	for key, state := range before {
		if !sameState(state, after[key]) {
			t.Fatalf("chunk %v changed after a rolled-back brush (dao version %d → %d, view version %d → %d)",
				key, state.daoVersion, after[key].daoVersion, state.viewVersion, after[key].viewVersion)
		}
	}
	if got := ledgerOf(t, p, brushPlayer); got != ledger || got.Check(2) != terrain_editor.Fresh {
		t.Fatalf("the ledger after a rolled-back brush: %+v (before %+v); sequence 2 is %v", got, ledger, got.Check(2))
	}
	result, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 2, corner)
	if err != nil || result.Duplicate || len(result.Chunks) != 4 || result.LastSeq != 2 {
		t.Fatalf("the same request after the rollback: %+v, %v", result, err)
	}
	if p.m.CommitFailures() != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("%d commits did not reach the view", p.m.CommitFailures())
	}
}

// 整字段守卫经玩家编辑入口（Policy 放大半径的运维 / 地基编辑；玩家 16m 笔刷单块至多约 800 点，到不了阈值）：一块里
// 改动超过 1000 点时整字段写，结果与纯计算逐点相同。
func TestTerrainBrushOverTheGuardWritesTheWholeField(t *testing.T) {
	pack := writeTerrainPack(t, t.TempDir(), 1)
	p := startTerrainProcessWith(t, pack, wholeMap, &memoryChunkStore{}, func(p *terrainProcess) {
		policy := terrainmap.DefaultPolicy
		policy.MaxRadius, policy.EditPointsPerSecond = 2500, 0
		p.m.SetPolicy(policy)
	})
	big := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushFlatten, X: 3200, Y: 3200, Radius: 2400, Target: 1500}
	if _, err := p.m.Brush(p.ctx, brushPlayer, 1, big); err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	want := expectBrushes(t, p.m, pack, big)
	viewMatches(t, p.m, want)
	if s := stateOf(t, p, terrain.ChunkKey{}); !slices.Equal(s.heights, want[terrain.ChunkKey{}].Heights) {
		t.Fatal("the chunk's DAO differs from the brush applied once")
	}
}
